        },
        {
          "text": "Lisiku line mundu jwakutyocela ku msinda wa Baala Shalisha ŵayice kwa Elisha ali amjigalile yakulya yanagowola pejo, ni mitanda ja mikate makumi gaŵili jetelece ni utandi wa balele jwa nagowola pejo. Yosopeyi ŵayijigalile mu msaku wakwe. Elisha ŵamsalile jwakutumicila jwakwe kuti, “Mwagaŵile ŵandu ŵakulocesya yakulyayo kuti alye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
