              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo jwakutumicila jwakwe ŵajanjile kuti, “Yakulyayi ngiyikwanila kwagaŵila ŵandu 100 wosopeŵa.” Elisha ŵamsalile kuti, “Mwagaŵile ŵanduwo kuti alye, pakuŵa AMBUJE akusala kuti, ‘Ŵanduwo talye yakulyayo nipo yine tiyisigale.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.43"
            ]
          }
